{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Danger Traps 2</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> hardcore platformer with multiplayer, where every move matters. Dodge deadly traps, find the shortest route to the finish line, and compete for the best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spikes, fire, guillotines, collapsing platforms \u2014 there's no room for mistakes. Only quick reflexes, precision, and clever thinking will get you to the top of the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udea9 FEATURES \ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Free to play</strong> \u2013 jump in and start playing without limitations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Deadly traps</strong> \u2013 every level is a dangerous maze filled with fire walls, spikes, moving platforms, collapsing bridges, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Ghost multiplayer</strong> \u2013 see other players running alongside you in real-time, but their actions won't interfere with yours. Who will finish first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 beat the clock and climb the <strong>Steam leaderboards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Multiple paths to victory</strong> \u2013 find the <strong>shortest route</strong> and discover hidden shortcuts to set new records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Over 30 levels</strong> \u2013 each with unique designs, mechanics, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Skins and customization</strong> \u2013 change your character's look and stand out from the crowd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Frequent updates</strong> \u2013 new levels, mechanics, skins, and improvements are added regularly to keep the game fresh and exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Single-player &amp; multiplayer modes</strong> \u2013 practice offline or compete with others online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/extras/ezgif-718c7b2a65aea3.gif?t=1744908246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Can you conquer all the traps and find the fastest path to victory?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your wishlist and get ready for deadly challenges! \ud83d\ude80</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562000?t=1744908246","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/7db2125fe7167d7d478e75ebd5a9ec3598641e3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744908246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/3064732806754a6b1f0a4210688ea5b65f025424/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744908246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/3064732806754a6b1f0a4210688ea5b65f025424/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744908246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Danger Traps 2</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> hardcore platformer with multiplayer, where every move matters. Dodge deadly traps, find the shortest route to the finish line, and compete for the best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spikes, fire, guillotines, collapsing platforms \u2014 there's no room for mistakes. Only quick reflexes, precision, and clever thinking will get you to the top of the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><str